      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7bedee65",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: jew_jerky_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image juxtaposes a religious figure on a cross with text that reads 'jew jerky: leave out in the sun until all moisture is gone, store in a cool dark place for 3 days.' This is a hateful antisemitic meme that uses a derogatory stereotype (jew jerky) to demean Jewish people, implying they are inferior or inedible. The visual of the crucifixion is used to reinforce the dehumanizing message, linking the stereotype to a religiously charged and historically traumatic symbol. The intent is to spread antisemitic hatred by associating Jewish people with a grotesque, degrading food metaphor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_3846eb9e"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
