      "label": "Jew Jerky Stereotype",
      "description": "A derogatory antisemitic stereotype that dehumanizes Jewish people by comparing them to a type of dried meat, implying they are inferior, inedible, or undesirable. This stereotype is rooted in historical antisemitism and is used to demean Jewish identity and worth.",
