      "instance_name": "crucifixion_symbolism",
      "label": "Crucifixion as a Religious Symbol",
      "description": "The crucifixion of Jesus Christ is a central event in Christianity, symbolizing sacrifice, suffering, and redemption. In this meme, it is used as a visual metaphor to dehumanize and associate Jewish people with a religiously charged and historically traumatic symbol, reinforcing the hateful message.",
