      "instance_name": "antisemitic_concept_dehumanization",
      "label": "Dehumanization of Jewish People",
      "description": "A core antisemitic concept that involves portraying Jewish people as less than human, often through grotesque metaphors or comparisons to animals or food. This is used to justify hatred, discrimination, and violence against Jewish communities.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
