      "description": "The meme uses the antisemitic stereotype of 'jew jerky' and maps it onto the crucifixion scene, dehumanizing Jewish people by portraying them as inedible food. This is a direct attack on Jewish people based on their identity, invoking historical antisemitism and religious symbolism to reinforce hatred.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
